                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Slush sends an\ninspector with a\nsilver ruler and\nno coat suited to",
                                        "Brassworks. He\nwants proof that\nyour nice parts\nbecome a safe",
                                        "process. Rivet\nagrees with the\nrequest while\nmoving his ruler\naway",
                                        "from the live\ncontacts with a\nwooden spoon."
